WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.033
Journey thirty: work in the admin application.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:09.109
Staff sign in through single sign-on from an allowed network, work in

00:00:09.109 --> 00:00:10.874
its shell, and sign out.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:17.245
The sign-in screen offers one way in: the staff account, confirmed with

00:00:17.245 --> 00:00:21.425
a second factor. There is no e-mail or password field.

00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:24.830
Here a stand-in plays the identity provider.

00:00:25.533 --> 00:00:30.783
Miriam is a moderator. The admin bar shows Listings, Reports with the

00:00:30.783 --> 00:00:36.261
unresolved reports, and Featured, with her name, her role, and Sign out.

00:00:37.204 --> 00:00:40.304
Daniel holds only the administrator role.

00:00:40.304 --> 00:00:45.369
Every Jubilee team screen tells him it is not for his role, and his

00:00:45.369 --> 00:00:47.788
navigation offers only Policies.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:53.060
Sign out ends the staff session on the server, and says so.

00:00:54.026 --> 00:00:59.373
Off an allowed network, the admin application says so, and offers no

00:00:59.373 --> 00:01:00.002
sign-in.

00:01:01.129 --> 00:01:05.800
In the app, an old admin link says the page has moved, and opens the

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.617
matching screen in the admin application.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:13.607
Behind the screen, the tests prove that every admin-only endpoint

00:01:13.607 --> 00:01:17.607
refuses a member session; that signing out of the app or the admin

00:01:17.607 --> 00:01:21.668
application leaves the other signed in; that staff cannot take down

00:01:21.668 --> 00:01:25.123
their own listing; and that every role change is audited.

00:01:26.001 --> 00:01:30.339
What is left is the owner's, in one checklist: register the application

00:01:30.339 --> 00:01:34.677
with the identity provider and require a second factor, set the allowed

00:01:34.677 --> 00:01:38.649
networks, grant the first administrator, and sign in once against

00:01:38.649 --> 00:01:39.321
production.
